-  // [0x148000000, 0x168000000), whose indices stop at 0x2d000, while a PE VA such as
-  // 0x71fe3d0000 gives 0xe3f000 -- far outside the committed bitmap pages.
+  // indexed by ADDRESS BITS -- word = addr >> 18, bit = (addr >> 12) & 63 -- and
